<section><h2>Arcade information and estimates</h2><p>Arcade pages, game lists, badge classifications, point calculations and reward information are provided for learning and planning. Program details can change. We make reasonable efforts to keep information current, but updates may be delayed or incomplete. Confirm eligibility, deadlines, points and rewards with official Google Skills and Arcade communications.</p></section>
<section><h2>Educational content</h2><p>Tutorials, videos, code samples and career content are provided for general educational purposes. Test code and commands in a safe environment and review official documentation before using them in production.</p></section>
